  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Cut the eggplant in half lengthwise and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast the eggplant in the oven for 30-40 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Let the eggplant cool slightly, then scoop out the flesh and chop it.",
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, minced garlic, and grated ginger. Cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the diced tomato and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the roasted eggplant, red chili powder, garam masala, and salt. Mix well.",
    "Adjust the seasoning to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve warm."
